BEGIN;
DO $guard$ BEGIN IF NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM lr_questions q WHERE q.qid=$batch05$PT105-S2-Q8$batch05$ AND q.stimulus=$batch05$Millions of female bats rear their pups in Bracken Cave. Although the mothers all leave the cave nightly, on their return each mother is almost always swiftly reunited with her own pup. Since the bats’ calls are their only means of finding one another, and a bat pup cannot distinguish the call of its mother from that of any other adult bat, it is clear that each mother bat can recognize the call of her pup.$batch05$ AND q.prompt=$batch05$The argument seeks to do which one of the following?$batch05$ AND q.correct_choice=$batch05$B$batch05$) THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Question changed: PT105-S2-Q8'; END IF; END $guard$;
